# Session continuity: make a small change, relaunch with -c, confirm kiln
# remembers, then walk /resume, /context, /cost, /export, /compact and
# rewind.
@real
@size 140x45
@fixture qa/fixtures/real/wf-sessions
WAITFOR /describe a task/ 30
SHOT ready
TURN Add a doc comment above the Greet function in greeter.go explaining what it does, in one short sentence.
SHOT changed
RUN cd {PROJ} && go build ./... && go test ./...
RELAUNCH -c
WAITFOR /describe a task/ 30
TURN What did we change last time, in one line?
SHOT recall
EXPECT /[Gg]reet/
SEND /resume
WAIT 2
SHOT resume-list
EXPECT /past session|No past sessions/
SEND /context
WAIT 2
SHOT context
EXPECT /\d+(\.\d+)?k of \d+k tokens/
SEND /cost
WAIT 2
SHOT cost
EXPECT /Session:/
SEND /export
WAIT 2
SHOT export
EXPECT /Wrote .* entries to/
RUN ls kiln-transcript-*.md
TURN /compact
SHOT compacted
EXPECT /[Cc]ompact/
KEY esc esc
SHOT rewind-menu
KEY esc
